WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 1]

01:49.140 --> 01:51.020
That day, blood stained
the crimson walls.

01:52.980 --> 01:54.060
Only then did I realize

01:55.380 --> 01:57.540
within these deep palace halls,
there is no true emotion.

01:58.900 --> 02:00.580
If fate grants me another life,

02:01.260 --> 02:03.620
I would tell you

02:04.300 --> 02:05.540
how, step by step, I went astray

02:06.740 --> 02:08.340
and fell beyond redemption...

02:11.450 --> 02:13.910
[Yunzhong Prefecture]

02:31.300 --> 02:32.460
Stop! Stop there!

02:32.700 --> 02:33.460
My horse!

02:36.860 --> 02:37.620
I'm Chu Zhao.

02:38.220 --> 02:39.100
I grew up

02:39.140 --> 02:40.700
in Yunzhong, a desert prefecture.

02:41.260 --> 02:42.220
This is part of the frontier.

02:42.540 --> 02:44.340
Foes from the Northern Desert
often invade.

02:44.940 --> 02:46.020
My mother died when I was little.

02:46.260 --> 02:47.740
I've been living with my father.

02:48.060 --> 02:49.300
He's a frontier general

02:49.900 --> 02:51.140
who has served for over a decade.

02:51.860 --> 02:53.180
My impression of Mother is just

02:53.380 --> 02:54.140
what Father told me

02:54.140 --> 02:56.020
in my childhood.

02:56.020 --> 02:57.100
[The Capital]

02:57.100 --> 02:57.860
The Capital is

02:58.780 --> 03:00.420
where my mother used to live.

03:00.980 --> 03:01.940
I longed so much

03:02.100 --> 03:02.940
to visit it.

03:03.580 --> 03:04.580
But my father forbade me

03:04.900 --> 03:05.900
to leave Yunzhong.

03:06.540 --> 03:08.060
Now, I've grown up.

03:08.540 --> 03:09.820
I can gallop on a horse, too.

03:10.100 --> 03:10.940
He, all alone,

03:11.100 --> 03:12.620
stands against thousands of troops.

03:12.700 --> 03:15.500
That's how he subdued
the Northern Desert all alone!

03:15.900 --> 03:16.340
Brilliant!

03:17.460 --> 03:18.020
Miss.

03:18.300 --> 03:19.580
You're so pretty. Want a flower?

03:23.340 --> 03:24.420
Carriages constantly move.

03:25.100 --> 03:26.020
People walk around.

03:26.780 --> 03:29.380
The city is crowded and bustling.

03:29.980 --> 03:30.940
When the scenes here

03:31.340 --> 03:33.220
became vivid in front of me,

03:33.860 --> 03:35.260
I finally realized something.

03:36.580 --> 03:38.660
How I wish my mother were still alive.

03:41.060 --> 03:42.980
How I wish she could stay by my side,

03:43.820 --> 03:45.900
choosing hairpins
for my coming-of-age ceremony,

03:46.780 --> 03:50.020
and see what I've become.

04:02.170 --> 04:03.410
Beat him! Kill him!

04:03.870 --> 04:04.830
Beat him!

04:05.420 --> 04:07.020
Kill him!

04:07.980 --> 04:09.100
Hit him hard.

04:27.180 --> 04:27.900
In broad daylight,

04:28.220 --> 04:29.140
how can you lynch him?

04:29.220 --> 04:29.980
Who are you, girl?

04:30.220 --> 04:30.700
Go away!

04:31.020 --> 04:31.780
He's terrible.

04:32.020 --> 04:33.500
Last night, he burned the Wei Village

04:33.700 --> 04:35.660
and killed 46 people.

04:35.860 --> 04:37.180
Death is too good for him.

04:37.300 --> 04:38.540
Let's kill him.

04:38.860 --> 04:39.700
By law,

04:40.020 --> 04:41.660
lynching is no different from murder.

04:42.260 --> 04:43.580
I've finally found you.

04:43.700 --> 04:44.260
Come on.

04:44.460 --> 04:45.500
Be good, will you?

04:45.500 --> 04:46.380
[Zhong Changrong,
deputy general of frontier troops]

04:46.380 --> 04:47.020
Sorry for this.

04:47.220 --> 04:47.980
- Mr. Zhong. - Sorry.

04:48.460 --> 04:49.820
They're killing him casually!

04:50.300 --> 04:50.900
Behave.

04:52.660 --> 04:53.540
Why do you stop me?

04:53.860 --> 04:54.940
They're in the wrong.

04:55.500 --> 04:55.900
You...

04:56.100 --> 04:57.020
Without interrogation,

04:57.340 --> 04:58.140
they convicted him

04:58.500 --> 04:59.260
and were trying to lynch him.

04:59.900 --> 05:00.940
Oh, you don't understand.

05:01.460 --> 05:02.740
Just stay out

05:02.740 --> 05:03.700
of the intricate affairs

05:03.740 --> 05:04.460
of these big clans.

05:04.700 --> 05:05.580
Your father

05:05.620 --> 05:06.260
gave me an order.

05:06.500 --> 05:07.660
I must take you back.

05:08.180 --> 05:08.580
Let's go.

05:12.940 --> 05:13.380
Excuse me.

05:13.820 --> 05:14.780
Please let us through.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.140
Leave. Leave now.

05:19.260 --> 05:21.300
Go away. Mind your own business.

05:28.180 --> 05:29.540
After less than a day in the Capital,

05:30.060 --> 05:32.060
I was taken back to Yunzhong
by Mr. Zhong.

05:32.740 --> 05:33.700
As expected,

05:34.180 --> 05:35.620
[Military Camp of Yunzhong Prefecture]
My father, over my sneaking away,

05:35.620 --> 05:36.420
flew into a rage.

05:37.020 --> 05:38.180
Yunzhong is so far away

05:38.180 --> 05:38.900
from the Capital.

05:39.860 --> 05:41.180
Do you know how many bandits

05:41.620 --> 05:42.660
and enemies are out there?

05:43.820 --> 05:44.380
What if...?

05:44.380 --> 05:44.980
What?

05:45.740 --> 05:46.580
Am I not standing here

05:46.620 --> 05:47.380
safe and sound?

05:48.140 --> 05:49.220
Why do you always want

05:49.260 --> 05:50.180
to trap me in here?

05:50.180 --> 05:51.740
[Chu Ling, the Guard General]

05:51.740 --> 05:52.780
When I was in the Capital,

05:53.380 --> 05:54.780
I visited my uncle and my cousin.

05:55.740 --> 05:57.820
I also experienced local customs there.

05:58.180 --> 05:59.140
How ignorant you are!

06:00.180 --> 06:01.980
You only know
the Capital is your mother's hometown.

06:02.380 --> 06:04.260
Do you know it's also a devouring cage?

06:04.260 --> 06:05.340
Father, don't scare me.

06:05.380 --> 06:06.620
I just missed my mother.

06:07.580 --> 06:09.300
I didn't grow up by her side.

06:09.300 --> 06:10.500
So I wanted to take a look.

06:11.260 --> 06:12.540
To look at the sights she saw

06:12.580 --> 06:14.180
and walk the lanes she walked.

06:15.180 --> 06:16.260
I wanted to find

06:16.740 --> 06:18.060
even the slightest trace

06:18.460 --> 06:19.860
of my mother's existence.

06:20.380 --> 06:21.780
How dare you bring her up?

06:23.060 --> 06:23.740
If she knew

06:23.740 --> 06:24.940
you were being so willful,

06:25.620 --> 06:26.980
she would be heartbroken!

06:27.300 --> 06:29.180
I just try to live on my own terms.

06:29.300 --> 06:30.260
Does it make me willful?

06:30.940 --> 06:32.380
If Mother were still alive,

06:33.300 --> 06:34.540
she wouldn't want me

06:34.540 --> 06:35.740
to be an obedient girl.

06:36.380 --> 06:37.780
She wouldn't be as arrogant as you.

06:38.980 --> 06:40.740
She would care about my feelings.

06:41.900 --> 06:42.380
Yeah.

06:43.780 --> 06:45.780
You're the undefeated God of War.

06:46.140 --> 06:47.900
You're the esteemed Guard General.

06:48.300 --> 06:49.380
But have you ever asked

06:49.380 --> 06:51.100
if I wish to be a general's daughter?

06:52.740 --> 06:53.660
Since childhood,

06:54.580 --> 06:56.260
other girls have had parents around.

06:56.420 --> 06:57.220
What about me?

06:57.980 --> 06:59.620
I've always been neglected.

07:00.980 --> 07:02.100
Have I ever cried

07:02.100 --> 07:03.380
or complained to you?

07:03.500 --> 07:04.460
I've never dared

07:04.460 --> 07:05.660
to ask you for a little concern.

07:05.660 --> 07:06.900
Because you've always been busy.

07:07.700 --> 07:08.380
You're busy

07:08.380 --> 07:09.420
protecting frontier people.

07:09.700 --> 07:11.460
You're busy forging your fame.

07:12.020 --> 07:12.620
You're too busy

07:13.340 --> 07:14.660
to ask your daughter

07:14.660 --> 07:16.260
what she really wants!

07:28.380 --> 07:29.140
Alan,

07:30.540 --> 07:31.380
I'm sorry.

07:32.540 --> 07:34.660
I failed to take good care
of our daughter.

07:35.260 --> 07:36.260
All I can do now

07:37.100 --> 07:38.740
is grant her wish.

07:45.280 --> 07:48.930
[Chu Mansion]

07:49.180 --> 07:50.260
What I said to Father

07:50.260 --> 07:51.700
must have broken his heart.

07:52.540 --> 07:54.380
Otherwise, he wouldn't have sent me

07:54.820 --> 07:56.140
to the Capital as I always wished,

07:56.620 --> 07:58.900
to the Chu Mansion granted
by His Majesty.

08:00.220 --> 08:02.140
I tried hard to learn manners,

08:02.340 --> 08:03.980
expecting to be a true noble lady

08:04.260 --> 08:05.060
in the Capital

08:05.060 --> 08:06.700
as my father described my mother.

08:07.660 --> 08:08.860
I'd behave gracefully

08:09.180 --> 08:10.340
and smile with lips closed.

08:12.300 --> 08:13.580
However, these things

08:14.140 --> 08:15.900
were far harder than I ever imagined.

08:18.740 --> 08:20.180
The way I wanted to be

08:21.500 --> 08:23.420
turned out to be ridiculous.

08:24.780 --> 08:25.860
It was at that moment

08:27.140 --> 08:28.780
that I met Xun.

08:33.300 --> 08:34.260
How are the stars here,

08:35.100 --> 08:36.300
compared to those in the desert?

08:37.300 --> 08:37.820
Zhao.

08:38.660 --> 08:39.580
They're as beautiful.

08:48.420 --> 08:49.580
That was the first time

08:49.900 --> 08:51.300
he called my name.

08:52.300 --> 08:53.380
And just because of that,

08:53.780 --> 08:54.820
I finally felt

08:54.820 --> 08:56.420
that the Capital had accepted me.

08:57.220 --> 08:58.940
Because someone here cared for me,

08:59.060 --> 08:59.620
thought of me,

09:00.180 --> 09:01.060
and cherished me.

09:02.340 --> 09:03.180
Shortly after that,

09:03.740 --> 09:05.820
Xun went to Yunzhong to propose.

09:12.300 --> 09:12.900
Zhao.

09:14.380 --> 09:15.300
The desert scenery is

09:16.100 --> 09:17.300
far grander than that of the Capital.

09:17.900 --> 09:18.820
It's been three years.

09:19.380 --> 09:20.660
You must have missed your hometown.

09:22.180 --> 09:22.900
Not really.

09:24.700 --> 09:26.540
Sand always swirls across the sky here.

09:27.780 --> 09:28.700
Seeing it too often

09:30.180 --> 09:31.300
makes it dull instead.

09:36.380 --> 09:37.420
You there, listen up!

09:38.020 --> 09:38.980
Give me

09:39.540 --> 09:40.540
all the valuables!

09:41.500 --> 09:42.020
Your Highness,

09:42.620 --> 09:43.220
we're ambushed.

09:48.740 --> 09:49.740
Be wise enough,

09:50.220 --> 09:51.460
and I'll let you live!

09:52.060 --> 09:52.700
Otherwise,

09:53.380 --> 09:54.820
I'll kill you all!

10:10.900 --> 10:11.380
Young man,

10:11.860 --> 10:12.460
who are you?

10:19.710 --> 10:21.350
[Fu Jiu, Chu family's retainer]

10:21.780 --> 10:22.460
How noisy.

10:27.900 --> 10:29.500
Lads, go get him.

10:53.380 --> 10:54.020
Your Highness,

10:54.580 --> 10:55.380
I've never seen

10:55.380 --> 10:56.340
such fierce swordsmanship.

10:57.140 --> 10:58.140
Every strike is fatal.

11:07.740 --> 11:08.500
I'm Fu Jiu,

11:09.340 --> 11:10.300
working for General Chu.

11:11.540 --> 11:12.220
He sent me

11:12.940 --> 11:13.740
to kill the bandits.

11:16.940 --> 11:17.740
Help me, my lord!

11:19.700 --> 11:20.260
Stay back!

11:21.140 --> 11:22.260
Or I'll kill her.

11:39.180 --> 11:39.780
Are you insane?

11:40.260 --> 11:41.100
She's innocent.

11:50.500 --> 11:51.100
Foolish.

12:02.620 --> 12:03.660
Her bracelet

12:04.020 --> 12:05.220
and the chief's necklace

12:05.300 --> 12:06.420
belong to the same set.

12:06.620 --> 12:07.420
Rare in the market.

12:08.380 --> 12:09.620
Just now, she deliberately

12:09.620 --> 12:10.780
rushed out from behind.

12:11.420 --> 12:13.020
So, the bandit managed to seize her.

12:14.860 --> 12:15.380
Xun,

12:16.500 --> 12:17.220
before departure,

12:17.700 --> 12:18.540
did you verify

12:18.860 --> 12:20.100
the identity of your attendants?

12:20.380 --> 12:22.940
The other day, I did notice

12:23.260 --> 12:24.700
some unfamiliar servants.

12:25.980 --> 12:26.980
But in a hurry,

12:27.660 --> 12:28.500
I didn't scrutinize.

12:32.380 --> 12:33.220
You were careless.

12:50.150 --> 12:52.150
[Yunzhong Prefecture]

12:52.940 --> 12:53.940
I've sincerely come here

12:54.180 --> 12:55.500
to propose to your daughter.

12:56.060 --> 12:56.740
Betrothal gifts are ready.

12:57.260 --> 12:58.020
Here is the list.

12:59.420 --> 13:00.380
Please review it.

13:03.780 --> 13:05.140
My daughter

13:06.340 --> 13:07.980
isn't good enough for a noble gentleman.

13:09.260 --> 13:09.940
Your Highness,

13:10.780 --> 13:11.940
I suggest you go back.

13:13.180 --> 13:13.820
Father,

13:14.500 --> 13:15.980
Xun and I love each other.

13:16.380 --> 13:17.700
What's wrong with his origin?

13:18.140 --> 13:19.420
If I can't marry him,

13:19.820 --> 13:21.020
why did you marry my mother,

13:21.020 --> 13:21.980
a noble young lady

13:21.980 --> 13:22.660
from far away?

13:22.780 --> 13:23.540
She stayed with you

13:23.540 --> 13:24.540
and wasted her life here.

13:24.540 --> 13:25.020
Shut up.

13:25.860 --> 13:26.580
Your mother...

13:27.580 --> 13:28.860
You have no right to judge.

13:29.180 --> 13:30.380
Then don't interfere with mine!

13:31.420 --> 13:31.860
Zhao,

13:32.780 --> 13:33.940
don't be angry with General Chu.

13:36.820 --> 13:37.420
General Chu,

13:38.020 --> 13:38.980
I know

13:39.060 --> 13:40.260
what you're worried about.

13:41.060 --> 13:42.020
Anyone who commands

13:42.940 --> 13:44.420
200,000 frontier troops

13:45.140 --> 13:46.220
would be worried

13:46.220 --> 13:46.980
that I pursued Zhao

13:47.380 --> 13:48.500
with ulterior motives.

13:49.020 --> 13:49.860
But I do not

13:50.740 --> 13:51.620
have any other motives.

13:52.660 --> 13:53.660
I only have a true heart.

13:55.860 --> 13:57.260
What's the value

13:58.980 --> 14:00.380
of a so-called true heart?

14:05.460 --> 14:06.220
Five years ago,

14:07.540 --> 14:08.500
I went to the Capital as a hostage.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.380
His Majesty gave me a mansion.

14:12.220 --> 14:13.460
To me,

14:14.740 --> 14:15.700
that is a reward

14:16.700 --> 14:17.580
as well as a shackle.

14:18.540 --> 14:19.540
I'm kept alive

14:20.420 --> 14:21.740
to counterbalance Xiaonan Prefecture.

14:23.020 --> 14:23.980
My father sent me there

14:25.140 --> 14:26.260
to protect our clan.

14:28.220 --> 14:29.460
I have no say in any of these.

14:30.500 --> 14:31.580
General Chu, you're right.

14:32.740 --> 14:33.940
No one would care

14:33.940 --> 14:34.700
about my heart.

14:36.980 --> 14:37.940
All these years,

14:38.900 --> 14:40.380
rumors in the Capital

14:40.580 --> 14:41.540
have never ceased.

14:42.900 --> 14:44.180
I'm used to tolerating them

14:44.180 --> 14:45.300
and not arguing back.

14:46.740 --> 14:47.700
But it's different now.

14:50.340 --> 14:51.420
I love Zhao.

14:51.820 --> 14:52.900
I don't want my love for her

14:52.900 --> 14:54.140
to be misunderstood.

14:56.060 --> 14:57.100
If I ever betray you,

15:00.860 --> 15:02.540
you could kill me now.

15:13.220 --> 15:14.220
Who are you trying to embarrass?

15:14.860 --> 15:16.060
Heir to the Lord of Xiaonan?

15:16.180 --> 15:17.060
Or my husband?

15:17.700 --> 15:18.500
If he really

15:18.500 --> 15:19.500
killed himself to prove it,

15:19.700 --> 15:20.740
would you be satisfied?

15:20.780 --> 15:22.060
We'll stop here on this matter!

15:26.500 --> 15:27.340
Your Highness,

15:29.180 --> 15:30.900
I suggest you go back.

15:34.700 --> 15:35.300
But General...

15:50.420 --> 15:50.980
General.

15:52.500 --> 15:53.020
Zhao!

16:14.540 --> 16:15.180
Where's my father?

16:16.460 --> 16:17.380
He's on a mission.

16:17.620 --> 16:18.300
He sent me to see you off.

16:22.540 --> 16:23.100
No need.

16:24.300 --> 16:25.100
You're like him.

16:25.620 --> 16:26.620
You both despise Xun.

16:27.100 --> 16:28.300
When you don't mean it,

16:28.820 --> 16:29.940
you don't need to pretend.

16:33.220 --> 16:33.980
Whatever you think.

16:35.220 --> 16:37.180
But if one day you regret it,

16:37.660 --> 16:38.500
come back anytime.

16:44.340 --> 16:45.500
Master said that.

16:47.860 --> 16:48.740
Then please

16:49.340 --> 16:50.540
take my message to General Chu.

16:53.580 --> 16:54.620
I won't regret it.

16:55.940 --> 16:57.140
Nor will I come back here.

17:14.420 --> 17:15.780
After I parted from my father,

17:17.140 --> 17:18.300
we never met again.

17:28.900 --> 17:31.200
[The 19th year of Tianshu.]

17:32.020 --> 17:33.900
After I returned to the Capital,

17:34.580 --> 17:36.180
I never stopped missing my father.

17:37.620 --> 17:38.900
It's not that he doesn't love me.

17:39.580 --> 17:41.540
He's just not good at showing his love.

17:42.460 --> 17:43.580
So, I often made

17:43.580 --> 17:45.020
his favorite jujube cakes

17:45.580 --> 17:47.780
and had them sent monthly to Yunzhong.

18:02.500 --> 18:03.580
Hang the red silk

18:03.820 --> 18:04.980
and your wish will come true.

18:07.860 --> 18:08.940
But still,

18:09.340 --> 18:11.020
Father didn't approve of this marriage.

18:11.740 --> 18:12.660
Two years later,

18:13.300 --> 18:15.340
Xiao Xun begged his father
to submit a memorial.

18:15.620 --> 18:17.180
They renounced their fief and troops.

18:17.700 --> 18:19.340
Finally, His Majesty granted
the marriage.

18:25.300 --> 18:26.940
I just made a divination for you.

18:27.300 --> 18:28.260
A pair of phoenixes fly

18:28.540 --> 18:29.500
and flap their feathers.

18:29.820 --> 18:30.420
Great luck.

18:31.100 --> 18:32.740
The 8th day of next month,
25 days from now,

18:32.860 --> 18:34.020
will be a rare lucky day.

18:34.300 --> 18:35.980
Everything will go smoothly.

18:38.820 --> 18:39.860
And anyway,

18:40.220 --> 18:41.940
even if His Highness dared to hurt you,

18:42.260 --> 18:43.780
General Chu wouldn't let that happen.

18:44.940 --> 18:45.340
Look.

18:52.860 --> 18:53.780
Fu Jiu said he was sent

18:53.780 --> 18:55.100
to deliver your dowry.

18:55.420 --> 18:56.420
But we all know.

18:56.740 --> 18:58.260
Your father sent him

18:58.260 --> 18:59.780
to stand up for you.

19:20.340 --> 19:21.300
Twenty five days later, it was

19:21.300 --> 19:23.060
the 8th day of the 8th month,
the 19th year of Tianshu.

19:23.740 --> 19:25.340
On my wedding night with Xiao Xun,

19:26.300 --> 19:27.380
rebels invaded the Capital.

19:28.100 --> 19:28.980
The whole city

19:29.900 --> 19:31.180
was ravaged by war.

19:34.540 --> 19:35.220
What happened?

19:35.540 --> 19:36.980
I heard the Third Prince
killed the Crown Prince

19:37.100 --> 19:38.100
and led a rebellion.

19:42.940 --> 19:43.540
Where's Xun?

19:43.860 --> 19:44.540
His Highness orders

19:44.700 --> 19:45.540
your protection.

19:45.900 --> 19:47.740
Please stay in the Chu Mansion.

19:50.980 --> 19:51.580
By order,

19:51.940 --> 19:53.100
you should stay here.

20:04.260 --> 20:06.220
Xun killed the Third Prince

20:08.060 --> 20:09.900
and ended this rebellion.

20:11.100 --> 20:12.500
An urgent message!

20:13.020 --> 20:14.380
The Emperor passed away!

20:14.940 --> 20:17.100
The Third Prince rebelled
and was executed!

20:17.580 --> 20:19.900
The Crown Prince
and the eldest imperial grandson died!

20:20.740 --> 20:22.660
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

20:23.220 --> 20:24.780
suppressed the rebellion!

20:24.980 --> 20:27.900
He'll take the throne,
by the late emperor's will!

20:34.420 --> 20:35.460
The Crown Prince died.

20:36.100 --> 20:37.300
The Third Prince was executed.

20:38.220 --> 20:40.300
The imperial grandson Xiao Yu
died in the mutiny.

20:41.260 --> 20:42.180
The late emperor died.

20:42.900 --> 20:43.620
In the royal clan,

20:44.100 --> 20:45.980
only Xiao Xun was left for the throne.

20:47.660 --> 20:48.380
Three days later,

20:49.100 --> 20:50.100
he ascended the throne

20:50.740 --> 20:51.980
and began his reign of the Anping era.

20:53.020 --> 20:54.220
This bloody fight for the throne

20:54.260 --> 20:55.420
came to an end.

20:56.020 --> 20:58.900
It was known as Anping Rebellion.

21:17.220 --> 21:18.780
Your Majesty,

21:18.940 --> 21:20.420
may you have longevity

21:20.660 --> 21:22.220
and a prosperous reign!

21:22.740 --> 21:24.460
Your Majesty,

21:24.580 --> 21:26.140
may you have longevity

21:26.300 --> 21:28.140
and a prosperous reign!

21:30.740 --> 21:32.420
Your Majesty,

21:32.500 --> 21:34.060
may you have longevity

21:34.260 --> 21:36.140
and a prosperous reign!

21:37.300 --> 21:38.860
Your Majesty,

21:39.020 --> 21:40.740
may you have longevity

21:40.900 --> 21:42.700
and a prosperous reign!

21:43.780 --> 21:45.220
Your Majesty,

21:45.460 --> 21:47.020
may you have longevity

21:47.300 --> 21:49.180
and a prosperous reign!

21:51.820 --> 21:53.020
I returned without a command.

21:53.420 --> 21:54.140
I know I'm guilty.

21:54.700 --> 21:56.460
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

21:58.300 --> 21:59.580
Don't say that, Father-in-law.

22:00.460 --> 22:01.580
You traveled day and night.

22:02.260 --> 22:03.380
Your love for your daughter

22:03.740 --> 22:04.620
is as clear as day.

22:05.340 --> 22:05.820
I...

22:06.260 --> 22:07.060
I'm quite gratified.

22:08.180 --> 22:09.460
I won't blame you.

22:09.980 --> 22:11.660
You once asked me

22:12.260 --> 22:13.140
about the value

22:13.740 --> 22:15.020
of my true heart.

22:15.540 --> 22:16.980
I was once a hostage.

22:17.500 --> 22:19.020
I know the pain of family separation.

22:19.740 --> 22:20.460
For Zhao,

22:20.980 --> 22:22.100
I request that you stay

22:22.300 --> 22:24.060
in the Capital.

22:24.820 --> 22:25.740
As for the border,

22:26.460 --> 22:27.860
I'll have everything arranged.

22:30.020 --> 22:30.780
I wonder

22:31.420 --> 22:33.060
if you will agree to my request.

22:39.700 --> 22:40.340
Your Majesty,

22:42.020 --> 22:43.420
I've devoted my life to ending the war.

22:44.500 --> 22:45.500
I have only one daughter.

22:46.420 --> 22:47.900
I treasure her more than

22:48.420 --> 22:49.380
my own life.

22:51.780 --> 22:52.740
Your Majesty,

22:53.940 --> 22:55.580
please take good care of my daughter.

22:56.020 --> 22:57.500
My 200,000 frontier troops

22:58.460 --> 22:59.820
will also devote themselves

22:59.820 --> 23:00.860
to the good

23:02.260 --> 23:04.220
of our nation.

23:06.060 --> 23:06.860
Of course.

23:35.260 --> 23:35.820
Jiu,

23:38.260 --> 23:39.100
from this day on,

23:39.580 --> 23:41.140
you'll stay here to protect Zhao.

23:42.340 --> 23:43.100
This is an order.

24:07.820 --> 24:08.940
After Xun's enthronement,

24:09.780 --> 24:11.460
Father hurried back to Yunzhong.

24:12.420 --> 24:13.900
He didn't attend my wedding.

24:15.060 --> 24:16.340
My marriage with Xun

24:17.020 --> 24:18.780
went against Father's will after all.

24:19.780 --> 24:20.300
Take a look.

24:21.100 --> 24:21.780
Satisfied?

24:26.940 --> 24:28.540
Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:33.740 --> 24:34.580
Yesterday,

24:35.260 --> 24:36.580
you suggested lower textile taxes.

24:37.060 --> 24:38.820
Can you explain that more clearly?

24:40.340 --> 24:41.740
As a thank-you for what I just did.

24:43.420 --> 24:45.100
Xun respected and loved me.

24:45.900 --> 24:47.140
An emperor like him

24:47.660 --> 24:49.220
often talked to me about state affairs.

24:49.980 --> 24:52.140
And he often carried out my suggestions

24:52.740 --> 24:54.100
to pacify the people.

24:55.380 --> 24:56.620
People praised him

24:57.060 --> 24:58.060
and their lives improved.

24:58.860 --> 24:59.540
I thought

25:00.180 --> 25:02.700
Father might feel a little relieved.

25:11.020 --> 25:12.660
[Everything is well. No need to worry.]
Every month, I wrote a letter to Father.

25:13.420 --> 25:14.700
Yet he never wrote back.

25:16.300 --> 25:18.020
I wanted these letters of reassurance

25:18.860 --> 25:20.940
to soothe Father's worries.

25:24.980 --> 25:26.380
The Spring Equinox
in the third year of Anping

25:26.940 --> 25:28.380
was my 22nd birthday.

25:29.260 --> 25:30.980
Because I missed Father too much,

25:31.300 --> 25:33.540
Xun allowed me
to invite Father for my birthday

25:34.100 --> 25:36.660
and promised he'd be welcomed
as the Empress's father

25:36.820 --> 25:38.420
and get a corresponding residence.

25:39.300 --> 25:40.620
I was nervous.

25:41.100 --> 25:43.180
I was also eagerly anticipating it.

25:45.100 --> 25:46.300
Soldiers, disarm.

25:47.380 --> 25:48.060
General,

25:48.500 --> 25:49.580
will we really disarm?

25:50.260 --> 25:51.500
It's Zhao's birthday.

25:53.380 --> 25:54.020
Let's do it.

26:02.260 --> 26:04.900
Chu Ling, the Guard General,

26:05.100 --> 26:06.540
is summoned for an audience!

26:40.100 --> 26:40.780
Go, Zhao.

26:41.340 --> 26:42.100
Later,

26:42.740 --> 26:44.060
I have a surprise for you.

26:46.940 --> 26:47.820
Thank you, Your Majesty.

26:49.460 --> 26:51.020
Greetings,

26:51.820 --> 26:52.780
Your Majesty.

26:58.300 --> 26:58.940
Father.

27:04.180 --> 27:05.620
You had a long trip, General.

27:08.460 --> 27:09.180
Read the edict.

27:10.460 --> 27:13.340
Edict for Chu Ling, the Guard General!

27:17.300 --> 27:17.860
Upon investigation,

27:18.620 --> 27:20.300
Chu Ling, the Guard General,

27:20.980 --> 27:22.380
coerced the Emperor

27:22.740 --> 27:24.180
and colluded with northern enemies.

27:25.380 --> 27:26.620
His brother Chu Lan

27:27.420 --> 27:30.820
poisoned the eldest imperial grandson
in the first year of Anping.

27:31.420 --> 27:33.540
The Chu clan shall be

27:33.980 --> 27:34.700
executed.

27:36.500 --> 27:37.260
Impossible!

27:38.500 --> 27:39.900
My father has always been loyal

27:39.900 --> 27:41.060
without any improper desires.

27:41.340 --> 27:42.580
My uncle has been timid.

27:42.980 --> 27:43.980
In no way would he poison

27:43.980 --> 27:44.980
the imperial grandson.

27:45.860 --> 27:46.300
You...

27:46.780 --> 27:47.780
You must be mistaken.

27:48.060 --> 27:49.140
Your Majesty.

27:49.340 --> 27:50.140
He is mistaken.

27:50.460 --> 27:51.660
Your Majesty, the other day,

27:52.180 --> 27:53.900
you said you'd give my father a mansion.

27:54.620 --> 27:55.620
Zhao,

27:56.900 --> 27:58.140
colluding with northern enemies

27:58.780 --> 27:59.860
is a grave crime.

28:00.340 --> 28:01.940
Your father did something foolish.

28:02.700 --> 28:04.100
Even if you're the Empress,

28:05.180 --> 28:05.700
I have to

28:06.780 --> 28:08.700
answer to all the people

28:08.700 --> 28:09.740
of my nation.

28:10.780 --> 28:11.660
In the first year of Anping,

28:12.300 --> 28:13.380
Your Majesty ascended the throne.

28:13.860 --> 28:15.580
Northern enemies
invaded Yunzhong at night.

28:15.700 --> 28:17.260
My father led 200,000 frontier troops

28:17.260 --> 28:18.940
to defend the town without retreating!

28:19.380 --> 28:21.140
Now, he's accused
of colluding with enemies!

28:21.500 --> 28:22.100
Who?

28:23.140 --> 28:24.100
Who accused him?

28:24.420 --> 28:25.460
Who offered the evidence?

28:26.180 --> 28:28.100
The truth must be sorted out.

28:28.300 --> 28:29.460
Otherwise, it's a frame-up.

28:30.620 --> 28:31.980
The Empress is delirious

28:32.820 --> 28:33.740
and spouting nonsense.

28:35.340 --> 28:36.100
Bring poisoned wine...

28:40.020 --> 28:41.180
and execute the Empress's father.

28:45.580 --> 28:46.220
Your Majesty.

28:46.900 --> 28:47.540
Your Majesty.

28:48.500 --> 28:49.060
Your Majesty.

28:49.460 --> 28:50.420
My father is innocent.

28:50.980 --> 28:52.020
He's innocent!

28:52.500 --> 28:54.340
Your Majesty, my father is innocent.

28:54.980 --> 28:56.100
He's innocent!

28:56.340 --> 28:57.780
I said, execute him!

28:59.180 --> 28:59.780
Xun!

29:00.220 --> 29:00.780
Xun!

29:03.140 --> 29:03.700
Xun.

29:06.180 --> 29:08.380
Xun. Xun.

29:08.540 --> 29:09.580
My father is innocent.

29:09.660 --> 29:11.340
Xun.

29:11.820 --> 29:12.980
Please spare my father.

29:13.100 --> 29:13.820
Xun.

29:25.180 --> 29:26.060
Changrong!

29:49.620 --> 29:51.140
You tread on the lives of frontier troops

29:51.780 --> 29:52.780
to appease your people

29:52.780 --> 29:54.060
and secure your nation!

29:55.020 --> 29:56.740
So, this turns out to be

29:57.340 --> 29:58.260
your true heart.

29:58.900 --> 30:00.180
I've never dared to forget

30:01.260 --> 30:01.740
what you said

30:02.500 --> 30:03.700
on my enthronement day.

30:04.340 --> 30:05.180
Rest assured.

30:05.740 --> 30:07.220
Your 200,000 frontier troops

30:07.500 --> 30:08.820
will still devote themselves

30:09.420 --> 30:10.100
to my nation

30:10.660 --> 30:11.500
and me.

30:12.340 --> 30:13.420
General Chu Ling

30:14.020 --> 30:14.860
pulled out his blade
in front of His Majesty,

30:15.740 --> 30:16.500
intending to rebel.

30:17.020 --> 30:17.780
Execute him now!

30:27.260 --> 30:27.900
Father!

30:28.260 --> 30:28.980
Father!

30:29.700 --> 30:30.100
Father.

30:31.300 --> 30:32.020
Are you all right?

30:32.700 --> 30:33.140
Father.

30:33.500 --> 30:34.420
Sorry, Father.

30:36.100 --> 30:36.700
Father.

30:36.780 --> 30:37.860
Father.

30:38.740 --> 30:39.340
Sorry.

30:40.020 --> 30:41.580
I'm sorry, Father.

30:43.100 --> 30:43.820
I'm sorry.

30:44.700 --> 30:46.100
It's my fault.

30:46.100 --> 30:46.820
Father.

30:47.220 --> 30:49.620
Father, I'm sorry.

31:03.900 --> 31:05.140
Xiao Xun, what do you want?

31:05.460 --> 31:05.900
Zhao.

31:05.980 --> 31:06.980
What are you going to do?

31:07.300 --> 31:07.780
No.

31:07.780 --> 31:09.180
This is my surprise for you.

31:09.500 --> 31:10.100
No!

31:10.500 --> 31:11.140
No!

31:11.740 --> 31:12.980
Xiao Xun, let go of my father.

31:13.260 --> 31:13.780
No!

31:14.020 --> 31:15.060
No!

31:25.980 --> 31:29.460
The Empress shall be given poisoned wine

31:29.580 --> 31:32.140
for the sake of her filial devotion.

31:51.060 --> 31:52.220
I know you hate me.

31:55.260 --> 31:56.220
But you know that.

31:57.260 --> 31:57.860
In this case,

31:59.260 --> 32:00.860
if I hadn't convicted Chu Ling,

32:01.940 --> 32:03.620
how could I bring his frontier troops

32:03.660 --> 32:04.420
under my control?

32:06.260 --> 32:07.460
Now, the whole nation

32:07.500 --> 32:08.460
is within my grasp,

32:09.700 --> 32:10.420
except for

32:10.460 --> 32:11.620
your father's troops!

32:12.300 --> 32:12.980
How can I

32:13.100 --> 32:14.700
secure this empire?

32:15.020 --> 32:16.140
Everyone in this nation says

32:17.660 --> 32:18.620
I wouldn't have succeeded

32:18.660 --> 32:20.060
without a woman's help.

32:20.780 --> 32:22.180
They never see my hard reforms

32:22.220 --> 32:23.500
over the past three years!

32:24.260 --> 32:25.820
They never see my diligent governance!

32:26.260 --> 32:28.020
They never see anything I've done!

32:28.300 --> 32:29.100
They can only see

32:29.260 --> 32:30.180
your father

32:30.660 --> 32:32.060
and his 200,000 frontier troops!

32:34.500 --> 32:35.340
But you said

32:37.660 --> 32:38.620
you didn't care.

32:39.740 --> 32:41.020
How could I not care?

32:42.340 --> 32:43.700
These 200,000 frontier troops

32:44.980 --> 32:46.300
were like a festering sore.

32:46.780 --> 32:47.540
Because of them,

32:48.020 --> 32:49.380
I couldn't sleep all night,

32:49.420 --> 32:50.380
tormented by pain.

33:02.500 --> 33:03.700
I know you want to ask me

33:06.020 --> 33:08.340
why I did all this on your birthday.

33:09.900 --> 33:10.900
Because Zhao...

33:11.740 --> 33:13.140
Without your letter,

33:14.260 --> 33:15.380
he wouldn't have come back

33:16.940 --> 33:18.380
or disarmed.

33:19.420 --> 33:20.460
I wouldn't have managed

33:21.340 --> 33:22.420
to accuse him of rebelling

33:23.420 --> 33:25.140
even without his soldiers.

33:27.100 --> 33:27.820
Zhao,

33:29.420 --> 33:30.340
you're so clever.

33:31.500 --> 33:34.460
How could you not know

33:35.700 --> 33:37.020
your letter would make him

33:37.020 --> 33:37.900
let down

33:38.540 --> 33:39.580
his guard?

33:40.420 --> 33:41.140
The 17th day of next month

33:41.740 --> 33:43.500
will be your 22nd birthday.

33:44.180 --> 33:44.860
I drafted a decree

33:45.100 --> 33:46.060
to summon your father.

33:46.820 --> 33:47.740
As the Empress's father,

33:48.540 --> 33:50.220
he'll have a residence
in the imperial city.

33:51.420 --> 33:52.060
Write a letter

33:52.700 --> 33:53.660
to tell him about this.

33:54.500 --> 33:55.420
Why?

33:56.100 --> 33:57.780
Why did you do this to my clan?

33:58.220 --> 33:59.980
Why did you do this to me?

34:00.260 --> 34:01.620
Why?

34:17.380 --> 34:18.220
Actually,

34:18.820 --> 34:20.420
whether he did or didn't disarm,

34:21.780 --> 34:22.780
he'd end up the same.

34:25.780 --> 34:27.780
After I sent him away
on my enthronement day,

34:29.580 --> 34:30.500
I secretly had my men

34:30.700 --> 34:33.340
poison the jujube cakes
you sent to Yunzhong.

34:34.060 --> 34:36.620
From the Capital to Yunzhong,

34:37.340 --> 34:38.500
they were delivered monthly.

34:40.860 --> 34:42.340
Chu Ling would be killed anyway.

34:43.340 --> 34:44.820
Not only by my blade,

34:46.060 --> 34:47.740
but also by his daughter's love.

35:13.860 --> 35:16.300
I'm going to kill you.

35:21.500 --> 35:22.460
Listen, Zhao.

35:24.820 --> 35:26.060
"In the third year of Anping,

35:28.140 --> 35:29.340
Chu clan was exterminated.

35:30.060 --> 35:31.500
Chu Ling, the Guard General,

35:33.140 --> 35:34.340
was guilty of treason

35:35.020 --> 35:35.980
and was executed.

35:37.300 --> 35:37.940
His daughter

35:39.100 --> 35:40.060
was so grieved

35:41.500 --> 35:43.180
that she hanged herself."

35:55.660 --> 35:56.820
Father is right.

35:57.540 --> 35:59.420
The Capital is a devouring cage.

36:00.700 --> 36:01.500
I wrongly believed

36:01.500 --> 36:02.900
his fake gentleness.

36:03.580 --> 36:05.660
I wrongly believed his fake loyalty.

36:06.420 --> 36:07.420
And I wrongly believed

36:08.580 --> 36:10.180
his insatiable ambition.

36:32.020 --> 36:33.460
It's him...

37:03.160 --> 37:06.360
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

37:06.400 --> 37:10.340
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

37:10.340 --> 37:12.740
I once had many choices in this life.

37:12.740 --> 37:14.180
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

37:14.180 --> 37:16.620
But I was so willful and ignorant.

37:16.620 --> 37:17.860
♪I'm my own pawn♪

37:17.860 --> 37:19.580
I made a wrong choice every time.

37:19.580 --> 37:21.300
♪I sigh at my fate♪

37:21.300 --> 37:23.300
I got my father killed.

37:23.300 --> 37:24.860
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

37:24.860 --> 37:26.740
I ruined my whole clan.

37:27.860 --> 37:28.860
Father!

37:29.340 --> 37:32.140
♪All the sand is washed away♪

37:32.140 --> 37:34.140
I got myself killed too.

37:35.440 --> 37:38.560
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

37:38.880 --> 37:42.120
♪I take a risk at every step♪

37:42.400 --> 37:47.280
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

37:47.640 --> 37:50.100
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

37:50.360 --> 37:53.360
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

37:53.600 --> 37:56.420
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

37:56.720 --> 38:02.850
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

38:03.740 --> 38:04.740
A pair of phoenixes fly

38:05.660 --> 38:06.500
and flap their feathers.

38:07.180 --> 38:07.780
Great luck.

38:10.560 --> 38:12.360
[The 19th year of Tianshu]

38:27.700 --> 38:29.300
Not to mention
the glorious dress and coronet,

38:29.300 --> 38:30.460
you even deserve the twelve ornaments
of imperial Robes.

38:31.340 --> 38:32.660
But I do not have any other motives.

38:32.860 --> 38:33.780
I only have a true heart.

38:33.940 --> 38:34.620
I love Zhao.

38:34.820 --> 38:35.900
I don't want my love for her

38:36.020 --> 38:37.100
to be misunderstood.

38:52.420 --> 38:53.340
Miss.

38:54.340 --> 38:55.340
What year is it now?

38:56.300 --> 38:57.300
You're so rude.

38:57.620 --> 38:58.260
Let go of me.

38:58.820 --> 39:00.580
It's the 14th day of the 7th month,

39:00.700 --> 39:01.540
the 19th year of Tianshu!

39:02.300 --> 39:03.140
Miss, don't do this.

39:03.180 --> 39:04.340
The 19th year of Tianshu?

39:04.660 --> 39:05.860
Don't you dare bully her!

39:06.180 --> 39:07.180
Don't be ridiculous.

39:07.340 --> 39:08.020
Just now,

39:08.180 --> 39:09.460
she almost hurt my hand.

39:10.340 --> 39:10.940
Miss.

39:11.340 --> 39:12.300
- Odd. - Are you fine?

39:13.820 --> 39:14.860
You're real.

39:16.340 --> 39:17.420
I just went away

39:17.420 --> 39:18.460
to fetch red silk.

39:18.780 --> 39:20.100
Miss, what happened to you?

39:24.820 --> 39:25.980
I'm still alive.

39:26.660 --> 39:28.100
Did you lose your mind?

39:28.660 --> 39:30.380
Or are you possessed?

39:31.420 --> 39:32.060
Shall I take you back

39:32.100 --> 39:33.220
and wash you with pomelo leaves?

39:35.820 --> 39:36.820
I'll go get His Highness.

39:36.940 --> 39:37.380
Zhao.

39:51.260 --> 39:52.260
Now I'm the Emperor.

39:52.260 --> 39:53.180
I'll never make you

39:53.220 --> 39:53.700
shed tears

39:53.700 --> 39:54.580
because of farewells.

39:54.580 --> 39:55.180
You only need

39:55.180 --> 39:56.020
to dress yourself up

39:56.020 --> 39:57.580
and make yourself beautiful.

40:09.220 --> 40:10.140
What's wrong, Zhao?

40:11.260 --> 40:11.940
Why are you crying?

40:12.220 --> 40:13.540
I'm going to kill you!

40:14.100 --> 40:14.900
You killed my father.

40:15.340 --> 40:16.220
I'll kill you!

40:16.820 --> 40:17.260
Miss.

40:18.140 --> 40:18.940
I'll kill you.

40:19.340 --> 40:20.460
I will.

40:32.820 --> 40:33.620
Thank you, Fu Jiu,

40:34.180 --> 40:34.900
for the dowry.

40:35.260 --> 40:35.860
Recently,

40:36.500 --> 40:37.620
she has been nervous

40:37.980 --> 40:38.740
about the wedding.

40:39.100 --> 40:39.660
So...

40:40.220 --> 40:41.300
The dowry's been delivered.

40:41.980 --> 40:42.540
I'll leave.

41:00.100 --> 41:01.380
Today, Zhao acted strangely

41:02.220 --> 41:03.380
toward me.

41:04.180 --> 41:05.940
What on earth happened

41:07.500 --> 41:08.940
that changed her like that?

41:09.620 --> 41:10.780
The bell in Sanqing Temple

41:10.940 --> 41:12.020
accidentally fell.

41:12.380 --> 41:13.740
Was she scared then?

41:14.180 --> 41:14.740
No.

41:17.140 --> 41:17.940
What she said was...

41:18.700 --> 41:19.580
"You killed my father.

41:20.020 --> 41:21.180
I'm going to kill you!"

41:23.100 --> 41:25.580
I've never shown hostility

41:25.620 --> 41:26.700
toward Chu Ling.

41:26.940 --> 41:28.300
Why did Zhao suddenly say

41:28.340 --> 41:29.220
something like that?

41:29.820 --> 41:32.820
Could she have known my plan?

41:54.780 --> 41:55.740
How did this happen?

41:59.940 --> 42:00.660
Miss,

42:01.460 --> 42:02.420
what happened to you?

42:02.900 --> 42:03.700
Shall I make a divination

42:03.700 --> 42:04.420
for you?

42:07.140 --> 42:07.700
Oh no.

42:08.100 --> 42:08.980
I'm not capable enough.

42:09.300 --> 42:10.780
I'll send for a Taoist master.

42:10.940 --> 42:11.420
Le,

42:15.020 --> 42:17.020
the 8th day of the 8th month this year

42:18.140 --> 42:20.140
is the wedding day for Xiao Xun and me.

42:20.860 --> 42:21.340
Right?

42:23.540 --> 42:25.460
His Majesty set this date.

42:26.580 --> 42:28.140
So, this is all real.

42:29.860 --> 42:31.100
Oh, you're bleeding.

42:31.180 --> 42:32.340
Don't you feel the pain?

42:35.140 --> 42:35.780
Yeah.

42:37.100 --> 42:38.460
When it hurts, it's real.

42:39.540 --> 42:40.380
It's real.

42:42.100 --> 42:42.860
Oh, dear.

42:43.300 --> 42:44.260
Don't scare me.

42:45.020 --> 42:46.060
What on earth happened?

42:46.060 --> 42:47.260
Could you please tell me?

42:48.140 --> 42:49.580
Why are you crying again?

42:53.540 --> 42:54.100
Le,

42:55.060 --> 42:56.620
go make some calming soup for me.

43:00.220 --> 43:00.660
All right.

43:46.900 --> 43:47.740
Who are you?

43:48.460 --> 43:49.740
I am you.

43:51.100 --> 43:52.620
I'm all your resentment

43:53.260 --> 43:54.380
and all your hatred.

43:55.740 --> 43:56.940
I'm the blade you brought back

43:56.940 --> 43:58.060
from the underworld.

43:59.180 --> 44:00.340
Just like the two sides

44:01.580 --> 44:03.220
of the robe.

44:05.300 --> 44:06.460
How did I come back to life?

44:06.900 --> 44:08.740
It's a heaven-sent opportunity.

44:08.940 --> 44:11.140
You can take your revenge.

44:15.740 --> 44:16.540
It's not easy

44:17.980 --> 44:19.540
to kill Xiao Xun.

44:20.420 --> 44:21.980
He's been scheming all the time,

44:22.500 --> 44:23.580
determined to be

44:23.580 --> 44:24.580
a decent gentleman.

44:25.020 --> 44:26.780
I have no chips to bring him down.

44:30.940 --> 44:32.420
My priority

44:33.660 --> 44:34.860
is to stay alive.

44:37.500 --> 44:39.460
Only when I'm alive can I save myself

44:39.980 --> 44:40.860
and save my father.

44:46.140 --> 44:46.820
Rest assured.

44:47.740 --> 44:48.740
I'll get revenge on Xiao Xun

44:48.780 --> 44:50.500
in the same way

44:51.980 --> 44:54.260
he ruined Chu family.

44:56.340 --> 44:57.380
I won't allow

44:59.220 --> 45:00.180
even the slightest

45:02.060 --> 45:03.180
difference.

45:12.560 --> 45:17.360
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

45:17.360 --> 45:19.960
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

45:19.960 --> 45:23.520
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

45:26.360 --> 45:28.600
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

45:28.600 --> 45:30.200
♪And roars in the blaze♪

45:30.400 --> 45:33.280
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

45:33.640 --> 45:36.080
♪Fate imprisons me♪

45:36.200 --> 45:40.920
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

45:41.280 --> 45:45.280
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

45:45.560 --> 45:49.480
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

45:49.720 --> 45:54.480
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

45:55.160 --> 45:56.880
♪With no fear of the distance♪

45:57.000 --> 46:00.560
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

46:00.800 --> 46:04.960
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

46:05.320 --> 46:10.560
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

46:10.680 --> 46:14.080
♪My new pride♪

46:28.520 --> 46:31.200
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

46:31.680 --> 46:34.160
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

46:34.440 --> 46:36.160
♪Amidst the chaos♪

46:36.160 --> 46:42.080
♪I'll always be with you♪

46:42.160 --> 46:44.680
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

46:44.960 --> 46:46.200
♪And roars in the blaze♪

46:46.560 --> 46:49.360
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

46:49.680 --> 46:52.200
♪Fate imprisons me♪

46:52.480 --> 46:56.960
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

46:57.440 --> 47:01.360
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

47:01.640 --> 47:05.480
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

47:05.800 --> 47:10.480
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

47:11.280 --> 47:12.880
♪With no fear of the distance♪

47:13.000 --> 47:16.600
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

47:16.840 --> 47:21.000
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

47:21.640 --> 47:26.560
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

47:27.000 --> 47:30.080
♪My new pride♪
